# Unrelated tooling that happens to live in this folder (not part of the site)
superpowers/
# `docs/*` rather than `docs/` on purpose: git never descends into an excluded
# DIRECTORY, so a `!docs/…` negation below would be ignored too.
docs/*
# …except the party booking docs, which are design notes for shipped code —
# the cross-venue metafield contract and the Google Calendar sync live nowhere
# else, and the next person to touch this needs them.
!docs/party-booking-handoff.md
!docs/party-calendar-additions.md
!docs/party-calendar-littletown.gs
